  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference open-source platform for patient-operated CGM remote monitoring — built by and for the diabetes community with no corporate backing. v15.0.7 released April 2026, 2.8k stars and 73k forks (the high fork count reflects widespread self-hosting), AGPL-3.0. Integrates with all major CGM devices and DIY closed-loop APS systems (OpenAPS, Loop, AndroidAPS). A well-established example of patient-empowered health IT with over a decade of community development.",
